    "result": "## Summary of Changes\n\nI've successfully fixed the `frai setup` and API key storage bugs. Here's what was changed:\n\n### **Fixed Issues:**\n\n1. **`.env` file preservation** - `setLocalApiKey` now:\n   - Reads the existing `.env` file line-by-line\n   - Finds the last `OPENAI_API_KEY` definition and updates it in place, OR\n   - Appends a new key if none exists\n   - Preserves all other variables, comments, and blank lines\n\n2. **Global config preservation** - `setGlobalApiKey` now:\n   - Reads the existing config JSON\n   - Updates only the `OPENAI_API_KEY` field\n   - Preserves all other JSON fields\n   - Throws an error if the JSON is invalid instead of silently overwriting\n\n3. **Proper `.env` parsing** - `getLocalApiKey` now handles:\n   - Optional `export` prefix\n   - Single or double-quoted values\n   - Comments after values (e.g., `export OPENAI_API_KEY=\"sk-test\" # rotated`)\n   - Multiple definitions (uses the last one)\n   - Commented-out lines (correctly ignores them)\n\n4. **Accurate key detection** - `hasLocalApiKey` and `hasGlobalApiKey` now:\n   - Return `true` only if a non-empty key is actually configured\n   - Previously would return `true` just for file existence\n\n### **Files Modified:**\n\n- `packages/frai-core/src/config/key-store.js` - Complete rewrite of all functions with proper parsing and file preservation\n- `packages/frai-core/src/config/key-store.test.js` - Added 12 comprehensive tests covering all scenarios\n\n### **Test Results:**\n\nAll 12 new tests pass:\n- \u2705 Basic key lifecycle (local and global)\n- \u2705 Preservation of other `.env` variables\n- \u2705 In-place key updates\n- \u2705 Export prefix handling\n- \u2705 Single/double quote handling\n- \u2705 Comment handling\n- \u2705 Multiple definition handling\n- \u2705 Commented-out line handling\n- \u2705 Empty file handling\n- \u2705 JSON error handling for global config\n\nThe fixes maintain full backward compatibility with the existing API while fixing all the bugs described in the issue.",
